    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C2",
      "text": "The SEGMENT_04 segment's revenue grew by 145% (rounded, per filing) from $47,405 million in the year ended January 28, 2024, to $116,193 million in the year ended January 26, 2025. The precise calculated increase is 145.11%, driven by strong demand for accelerated computing and AI solutions, specifically a 162% growth in Data Center computing revenue and a 51% growth in Data Center networking revenue.",
